### Component 3: Middleware Stack

#### [NEW] `apps/backend/internal/middleware/logger.go`
- Mencatat setiap request HTTP ke stdout dalam format JSON terstruktur (method, path, status_code, duration_ms, ip, user_agent, trace_id).

#### [MODIFY] [`apps/backend/internal/middleware/recovery.go`](file:///d:/agent%20v2/apps/backend/internal/middleware/recovery.go)
- Menangkap panic goroutine, mencatat stack trace via `slog.Error`, dan mengembalikan HTTP 500 JSON tanpa mematikan server.

#### [NEW] `apps/backend/internal/middleware/cors.go`
- Mengonfigurasi CORS ketat berdasarkan whitelist origin, mendukung methods `GET, POST, PUT, PATCH, DELETE, OPTIONS`, header `Authorization, Content-Type, X-Request-ID, X-Idempotency-Key`, dengan max-age 3600 detik.

#### [NEW] `apps/backend/internal/middleware/ratelimit.go`
- Implementasi sliding window counter pada Redis 7:
  - Default: 100 req/menit per IP.
  - Endpoint AI: 20 req/menit per user.
  - Mengembalikan header `X-RateLimit-Limit`, `X-RateLimit-Remaining`, `X-RateLimit-Reset`.
  - Mengembalikan HTTP 429 Too Many Requests jika kuota habis.

#### [NEW] `apps/backend/internal/middleware/auth.go`
- Stub middleware otentikasi JWT yang mengekstrak user ID dan role ke dalam Echo Context untuk digunakan handler downstream (implementasi penuh terintegrasi Keycloak di Fase 3).

