### Component 4: Handlers, Metrik & Entrypoint

#### [MODIFY] [`apps/backend/internal/handler/health_handler.go`](file:///d:/agent%20v2/apps/backend/internal/handler/health_handler.go)
- `GET /healthz`: Liveness probe (HTTP 200 instan).
- `GET /readyz`: Readiness probe yang menguji koneksi aktif live ke:
  - PostgreSQL (`pool.Ping`)
  - Redis (`client.Ping`)
  - Docker Daemon (ping Docker API via socket)
  - Mengembalikan 200 OK jika semua sehat, atau 503 Service Unavailable dengan rincian komponen yang gagal.

#### [NEW] `apps/backend/internal/handler/metrics_handler.go`
- Mendaftarkan dan mengekspos metrik Prometheus via `promhttp.Handler()`:
  - `http_requests_total` (counter: method, path, status_code)
  - `http_request_duration_seconds` (histogram: method, path)
  - `active_websocket_connections` (gauge)
  - `db_pool_active_connections` & `db_pool_idle_connections` (gauge)

#### [MODIFY] [`apps/backend/cmd/server/main.go`](file:///d:/agent%20v2/apps/backend/cmd/server/main.go)
- Mengorkestrasi pemuatan konfigurasi, inisialisasi logger, koneksi pool Postgres, koneksi Redis, eksekusi auto-migration, registrasi middleware, binding rute `/healthz`, `/readyz`, `/metrics`, dan start server.
- Menangani `signal.NotifyContext` (SIGTERM/SIGINT) dengan graceful shutdown (timeout 30 detik), penutupan koneksi database pool, dan Redis.

#### [MODIFY] [`apps/backend/Dockerfile`](file:///d:/agent%20v2/apps/backend/Dockerfile)
- Optimasi multi-stage build Alpine (`golang:1.22-alpine` builder -> `alpine:3.19` runtime), non-root user `appuser`, CGO_ENABLED=0, dan healthcheck CMD.

